    "body": "Part of #36692. Follow-up to #36750\n\nReplaces field-by-field construction of inputs and outputs with `COutPoint`, `CTxIn` and `CTxOut` ctor calls in `txpackage_tests`, `bench/duplicate_inputs` and `script_p2sh_tests`.\n\n`CMutableTransaction` is kept as the builder while a `CTransaction` constructor is discussed in #36696. Witnesses are still assigned after `vin`, since `CTxIn` has no witness argument yet.\n\nTest-only; the constructed transactions are unchanged.\n\n- `script_p2sh_tests`: two outputs created by `vout.resize(1)` never had a value, so their null `nValue` (`-1`) is now explicit.\n- Intentional mutations are left as they are: the `scriptSig` swap in `sign`, the dummy signing in `ValidateInputsStandardness`, and the witness-only copies in `txpackage_tests` (`mtx_child2`, `mtx_parent2_v2`).",
