        "payload": "tree d47556e1e3344ac85261358e4e70a2145d569268\nparent 3b1ba022efd763da64684d274419b3f31d14a17f\nauthor yuvicc <yuvichh01@gmail.com> 1793875073 +0530\ncommitter yuvicc <yuvichh01@gmail.com> 1793875073 +0530\n\ntest: construct txpackage_tests inputs/outputs declaratively\n\nReplace the field-by-field construction of the inputs and outputs in\ncreate_placeholder_tx, mtx_child1 and mtx_parent2_v1 with COutPoint,\nCTxIn and CTxOut constructor calls.\n\nAs in BuildSpendingTransaction, the scriptWitness assignment must come\nafter vin is replaced, since CTxIn has no witness constructor argument.\n\nIn create_placeholder_tx, the random values are drawn in the same order\nas before, so the placeholder transactions are unchanged.\n\nThe constructed transactions are unchanged.\n",
