      "message": "test: construct script_p2sh_tests inputs/outputs declaratively\n\nReplace field-by-field construction of inputs and outputs with\nCOutPoint, CTxIn and CTxOut constructor calls.\n\nOutputs previously created by vout.resize() without a value now spell\nout the null nValue (-1) explicitly. Loop indices become uint32_t to\nmatch COutPoint::n, since brace-initialization rejects the narrowing.\n\nThe scriptSig mutations after signing are intentional and kept.\n\nThe constructed transactions are unchanged.",
